    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to defend your village in Champi, a captivating Tower-Defense where your mission is to repel an invasion of mutated mushrooms.\u00a0Faced with the threat of a mycelian abomination, every strategic decision counts to protect your territory. With immersive graphics and challenges, Champi immerses you in a world where survival depends on your ability to eradicate this fungal threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game is unique and depends on your strategic choices. Try, Learn, and try again !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 Turrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >29 Passives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Unique enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 Map</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More content coming soon !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy !</p>",
